error[E1018]: a type annotation on a binding needs `:`
 --> tests/parser/fail/E1018_missing_type_colon.tarn:2:5
  |
2 |     limit u64 := 100
  |     ^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = note: see ADR 0011: `x: T := v` and `var x: T = v`
  = help: write `limit: u64 := ...`

